[issue.1558]
number = 1558
title = "[Coherence] The commit message says the perps callers, the boundary-check rule and the served-methods golden were changed, but the commit only edits spec, gotcha and qualification records"
revision = "210639d0360c53f5c2fdd81c9c7c5e84b24b8c84"
verdict = "task"
evidence = "The subject of c1f5f4d31ef0f4885db9b4203821d350fd249cb1 claims implementation although its diff changes only GOTCHA.kvx, spec/layerx-merge/qualification.kvx and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx; the later SDK fix c31ded3a33b5c890e15e40b05be99c5b763307e9 now encodes the real ABI at services/agent/sdk/typescript/src/perps.ts:740-753 with ABI-derived assertions at services/agent/sdk/typescript/test/perps-v2.test.ts:33-88, and the web page uses real signatures at apps/web/src/app/exchange/exchange-client.tsx:72-77, but wallet cancellation at sdk/wallet/src/modules/exchange.ts:54, the substituted web-test ABI at apps/web/e2e/exchange-perps.test.ts:50-55, the manifest rule at services/human/tools/boundary-check/src/lib.rs:255-259 and the missing px_getReceiptKeys row between rpc/testdata/served_methods_http.golden:100-101 remain assigned to pending tasks at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:119043, spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:119012, spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:175311 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:191684, so the historical implementation claim still needs a published correction."
close_comment = "Commit c1f5f4d31ef0f4885db9b4203821d350fd249cb1 records decisions 2387-2393 and follow-up tasks; its subject overstates the implementation delivered by that commit. The SDK ABI correction arrived separately in c31ded3a33b5c890e15e40b05be99c5b763307e9, while wallet compatibility, the remaining web proof, boundary manifest-rule retirement and the served-methods golden refresh remain tracked separately."

